          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">The WalkingPad Z1 is a good-value, fold-in-half walking pad for
            walkers comfortably under 242 lb who need it out of sight.</strong> Its walking area,
            folded size, weight and capacity are confirmed across WalkingPad, Amazon and an independent
            review; its motor and noise figures are not. At $299, sold and supported by KingSmith
